Z||000000||Robert||02-19-2000||12:10 PM||||I just got CarParts.com to create a banner for me (and everyone else) with a Yellow Fiero.  They didn’t use my car, believe me I tried, but at least it’s a yellow GT.  You can check it out at my web site I’m still working on.  Its on page 3. <A HREF="http://www.canterburytrails.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.canterburytrails.com/</A> <BR>By the way, CarParts.com is for real when they say you can earn money by having their banner on you web page.  I received a check for $51.00 last month, for parts I had bought myself using a different email.  With this additional money + their already low price, the Jamex lowering springs for my car only cost me $138.00<BR>||||reg||10
